{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863507402871930901","content":"There is a pigeon carving the word goose on the side of your boat.","created_at":"2021-07-12T09:34:36.493000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864077276484337664","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"863507402871930901","content":"As Talia awakens to the dull scratching on the hull, she stumbles to the deck with that drowsy urgency.\nDriving the pigeon off with a frustrated roar, she takes a moment to collect herself before spending the morning buffing the wood back into shape.","created_at":"2021-07-12T17:10:22.170000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864191972566630410","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"863507402871930901","content":"Between bits of work, just below the ship’s deck, she lights a smoldering flame in a cheap brass bowl, complimenting it with sigil and incantation in casting *find familiar.*\nThe pleasant smell of the burned incense wafts out of the airship.","created_at":"2021-07-12T17:30:04.727000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864196932568875028","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"863507402871930901","content":"She finishes the spell at around the same time her dusty radio unit buzzes to life from the only frequency it’s ever set to.\nA bittersweet smile crosses her face at the news as she withdraws a very disgruntled bat from the ashes of the ritual. Dismissing the thing immediately to it’s extradimensional space, she makes her way outside.","created_at":"2021-07-12T18:49:51.844000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864217011193511966","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863507402871930901","content":"next to the word goose, this pigeon carves the word \"Murder.\"","created_at":"2021-07-13T06:43:47.014000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864396674918514719","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"863507402871930901","content":"Talia returns to her ship, spying the new word with a labored sigh. With the culprit gone, she sets to work smoothing out her vessel again.","created_at":"2021-07-13T21:48:42.549000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864624406898933760","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
