{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"nut_wizard","id":"594008151779573762","is_bot":0,"username":"nut_wizard"},"author_id":"594008151779573762","channel_id":"863507402871930901","content":"Showing her face to the moonlight again on one of many sleepless nights, Talia growls with frustration at the continued graffiti.\nAfter tonight’s broadcast, though, no time was to be wasted repairing it, and she sets out for Kingsbridge.","created_at":"2021-07-14T08:23:31.214000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"864784162338897932","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
